# class: field-spelling
# note: parseSchField folds a mandatory field name case-insensitively, so KiCad reads "VALUE" as the power symbol's Value and names the net unconnected-GND; parity compared "Value" exactly
# main: erc 1 fail; drc-parity 0 pass
# erc: 3 MalformedSchematic kicad_sch/symbol[1]/property[2]
# drc-parity: 3 MalformedSchematic kicad_sch/symbol[1]/property[2]
@@ find
		(property "Value" "GND"
			(at 25.4 16.51 0)
@@ replace
		(property "VALUE" "unconnected-GND"
			(at 25.4 16.51 0)
@@ end
